---
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
---

<section class="about-section about-section--grounding" aria-labelledby="about-grounding-heading">
  <Wrapper variant="standard" class="about-section__grid">
    <p class="about-section__label">03 / The room still matters</p>
    <div class="about-section__body">
      <h2 id="about-grounding-heading">The workflow has to work outside the diagram.</h2>
      <div class="about-prose about-prose--columns">
        <p>
          Outside HobFarm, I work in live entertainment and technical production in Las Vegas.
          That environment is practical: schedules move, equipment fails, crews arrive with
          different assumptions, requirements change, and the show still has to happen.
        </p>
        <p>
          HobFarm carries the same operating habit into publishing and digital work. Define the
          job, keep the people and material aligned, solve the real failure, and deliver the result.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Wrapper>
</section>

